WEBVTT

00:14.960 --> 00:16.800
The press conference for the launch of
The Memory The Series.

00:16.800 --> 00:18.360
Why do we not know about any of this?

00:19.320 --> 00:20.760
Just walk away from the Dream!

00:20.960 --> 00:23.720
It’s for the safety of the people around you.

00:24.560 --> 00:26.920
If you want revenge so badly,take it out on yourself.

00:27.600 --> 00:29.680
but it will cause trouble for people around you as well.

00:31.320 --> 00:32.240
What are you going to do?

00:33.200 --> 00:34.560
I came.

00:35.800 --> 00:37.160
Now you guys can let him go.

01:35.520 --> 01:36.360
Sky?

01:38.200 --> 01:41.200
You just came? I heard that you’ve been calling for us.

01:42.400 --> 01:43.880
I'll hurry and get you the money.

01:45.960 --> 01:48.120
You already got me the money.

01:54.360 --> 01:55.160
I'm sorry.

01:59.800 --> 02:00.640
I'm really sorry.

02:01.920 --> 02:02.760
I'm sorry.

02:05.360 --> 02:07.280
How's it been, trying to take your revenge?

02:08.280 --> 02:09.520
Feeling any better?

02:18.720 --> 02:20.079
It's not what you think, is it?

02:20.800 --> 02:21.400
So...

02:22.440 --> 02:23.280
I think…

02:25.320 --> 02:27.160
You can stop running after me, and Mom now.

02:35.160 --> 02:36.000
P’Sun,

02:38.800 --> 02:41.040
you need to live your life.

03:16.120 --> 03:16.960
Mom.

03:48.520 --> 03:49.360
P’Sun!

05:05.560 --> 05:06.360
P’Sun!

05:07.600 --> 05:08.440
P’Sun!

05:08.640 --> 05:10.000
Are you awake?

05:10.680 --> 05:11.760
P’Sun, do you remember me?

05:12.040 --> 05:13.720
I’m the person that you really adore, remember?

05:14.560 --> 05:15.400
Sun!

05:23.880 --> 05:25.200
Do you remember us?

05:25.760 --> 05:26.600
Who am I?

05:34.840 --> 05:35.720
My Manager.

05:42.560 --> 05:44.040
You've been sleeping for weeks,

05:44.520 --> 05:46.480
even though the surgery went well.

05:48.720 --> 05:50.520
We're so very worried.

05:53.720 --> 05:55.680
I’m so thankful for you that day.

05:56.560 --> 05:57.840
If it wasn’t for you that save me,

05:58.480 --> 05:59.120
I would…

05:59.120 --> 05:59.680
You won’t.

06:05.640 --> 06:06.240
Really,

06:07.600 --> 06:08.960
everything that happened.

06:10.480 --> 06:12.320
It came out of my own resentment.

06:15.240 --> 06:15.920
Okay,

06:18.080 --> 06:19.560
The fact that you survived is beyond good news.

06:22.360 --> 06:24.440
Next time, don't do this again. I'm begging you.

06:41.120 --> 06:43.280
Sky, can you put the bed upward?

06:50.000 --> 06:50.840
You okay?

06:57.280 --> 06:58.000
Alright?

07:18.960 --> 07:19.800
TWO-O

07:20.480 --> 07:22.040
has anyone heard about him?

07:26.360 --> 07:27.280
Not yet.

07:31.360 --> 07:32.200
Here you go!

07:33.680 --> 07:35.240
You used to love this, didn't you?

07:39.560 --> 07:40.720
P’Pong?

07:45.440 --> 07:46.720
You can eat this

07:47.480 --> 07:48.480
when you get better, alright?

07:50.720 --> 07:51.560
Hey!

07:54.800 --> 07:55.840
Let go.

08:04.000 --> 08:04.520
Let go of it!

08:23.000 --> 08:24.120
How did you even come?

08:24.560 --> 08:29.920
Oh here, I’m representing Speed Express.

08:32.919 --> 08:33.640
Before this,

08:34.320 --> 08:37.240
when you were taking other people's shifts to help them,

08:38.240 --> 08:39.440
it meant a lot to them.

08:41.200 --> 08:42.240
But of course, you didn’t know that, right?

08:45.360 --> 08:48.560
I didn't think it would matter to anyone.

08:50.440 --> 08:51.960
It’s fine. It’s good that you’re awake.

08:52.240 --> 08:52.800
Here.

08:53.160 --> 08:54.800
These are your friends.

08:55.200 --> 08:57.120
They pitched in to get these for you.

08:58.240 --> 08:59.840
You have to eat it all.

09:00.520 --> 09:04.000
And be careful of others, they might steal it.

09:04.760 --> 09:05.600
Oh, hey!

09:07.120 --> 09:09.560
Right, I'll head back first.

09:09.640 --> 09:11.640
I will deliver them the good news that you’re awake.

09:12.040 --> 09:13.000
I'll put it here.

09:13.840 --> 09:14.760
Thank you.

09:16.680 --> 09:17.560
Eat it all, okay?

09:19.360 --> 09:21.360
You two better be careful!
I’m keeping both of my eyes on you.

09:23.160 --> 09:23.920
What!?

09:24.560 --> 09:25.360
What a crazy man!

09:26.520 --> 09:27.360
Hey.

09:32.760 --> 09:33.760
Who is this again?

09:38.560 --> 09:39.520
I'm sorry,

09:39.800 --> 09:41.200
but I think you came to the wrong room.

09:42.120 --> 09:44.000
Oh, hi, uncle.

09:46.680 --> 09:47.520
Sia?

09:49.560 --> 09:51.360
Oh, this uncle is

09:51.440 --> 09:53.760
the person who helped me when Sun passed out.

09:58.480 --> 09:59.240
Thank you so much.

10:00.160 --> 10:01.760
Since you two seem to know each other so well.

10:02.880 --> 10:06.640
I’ll let you two be.

10:06.640 --> 10:07.760
We should go eat.

10:11.360 --> 10:13.000
Take care, alright?

10:15.560 --> 10:16.360
Let’s go.

10:22.360 --> 10:23.760
Wait up, Mr. Manager.

10:29.560 --> 10:31.320
If you ever need someone for a male lead,

10:33.520 --> 10:34.480
do not hesitate to call me, okay?

11:00.600 --> 11:01.720
Why the heck would you sit up?

11:04.120 --> 11:05.920
Didn’t you look that they nearly stabbed your gut out,

11:06.360 --> 11:07.400
and you’re still acting tough?

11:09.440 --> 11:10.600
How did you come?

11:11.640 --> 11:14.120
Sia Jo, he called me.

11:14.480 --> 11:15.840
He said that you might be in trouble.

11:16.400 --> 11:17.680
Although I didn't believe him.

11:18.720 --> 11:20.600
So I went to see it with my very own eyes.

11:22.560 --> 11:23.560
Sia Jo from Alice?

11:25.520 --> 11:26.440
That's right.

11:26.880 --> 11:27.720
Sia Jo,

11:27.920 --> 11:31.280
or that bastard from Alice is my pal.

11:32.040 --> 11:32.880
We’re tight.

11:33.120 --> 11:34.000
When we were younger,

11:34.240 --> 11:35.200
we've been to bathhouses together,

11:35.600 --> 11:36.440
but now

11:36.720 --> 11:37.880
it looks like he has his own bathhouse now.

11:39.480 --> 11:39.920
Confused?

11:41.200 --> 11:44.920
He also used to call,

11:45.640 --> 11:47.520
and fact check your story with me.

11:48.120 --> 11:49.240
And after he knew

11:49.480 --> 11:51.680
that you had to work your ass off to pay my debt,

11:52.040 --> 11:53.920
he cried like an old looking freaking baby.

11:54.360 --> 11:55.400
I don't know what the hell is wrong with him.

11:55.720 --> 11:57.240
That bastard likes to act all dramatic.

12:05.120 --> 12:08.840
So, I owe you again?

12:11.960 --> 12:13.760
This one you didn’t ask for.

12:14.440 --> 12:15.760
And I'm willing to help

12:16.680 --> 12:17.360
so I don't count.

12:21.760 --> 12:22.760
Thank you.

12:24.360 --> 12:26.880
And when I passed out,

12:28.240 --> 12:29.240
what happened?

12:47.200 --> 12:48.160
Who are you?

12:50.600 --> 12:52.600
Don't you remember your daddy's face, boy?

12:54.080 --> 12:54.880
Finish him!

13:03.760 --> 13:04.560
Hey!

13:05.560 --> 13:06.680
Are you really in trouble?

13:14.800 --> 13:15.600
And you?

13:19.040 --> 13:21.240
Oh, you still look fine.

13:22.120 --> 13:23.760
Looks like I still have time for something fun.

13:28.240 --> 13:29.440
Beat the shit out of him!

14:33.680 --> 14:34.760
Since when did you come back?

14:44.200 --> 14:44.920
Are you angry?

14:57.480 --> 14:58.640
The suicide scene,

15:00.640 --> 15:01.840
now I get it.

15:03.080 --> 15:04.560
Why you portrayed the scene that way.

15:07.320 --> 15:08.400
What do you mean?

15:10.080 --> 15:11.480
You put your life at risk,

15:13.440 --> 15:15.840
even though I told you to only focus on yourself.

15:18.520 --> 15:20.080
Thirty missed calls from me.

15:21.280 --> 15:22.400
You didn’t answer my calls at all.

15:24.720 --> 15:26.720
If you have to choose between death and me,

15:28.560 --> 15:29.960
you would choose death without any hesitation, right?

15:32.640 --> 15:33.160
I don't…

15:33.240 --> 15:33.920
You feel guilty.

15:39.000 --> 15:42.120
because you blamed yourself for your brother's
and mother's deaths.

15:56.920 --> 15:57.760
Jay.

16:00.160 --> 16:00.960
Jay!

16:03.480 --> 16:04.640
Put the knife down!

16:06.120 --> 16:07.080
We can talk.

16:12.120 --> 16:13.000
Jay.

16:13.480 --> 16:13.960
Jay.

16:13.960 --> 16:14.560
Jay, don’t.

16:14.760 --> 16:15.280
No.

16:15.280 --> 16:16.280
Jay, please.

16:19.240 --> 16:20.360
Jay, don't.

16:20.360 --> 16:21.160
Jay.

16:25.320 --> 16:26.400
No, Jay.

16:27.040 --> 16:27.520
Jay!

16:27.800 --> 16:28.440
Jay, stop!

16:29.360 --> 16:29.960
Jay!

17:00.040 --> 17:00.880
How do you feel now

17:03.520 --> 17:04.680
to be the one who’s trying to kill me?

17:32.120 --> 17:33.080
I'm sorry.

17:39.920 --> 17:41.000
I'm really sorry.

18:44.640 --> 18:45.440
Ahh.

18:46.520 --> 18:47.520
Two baht guy,

18:49.200 --> 18:50.720
you’re looking for my Jay, right?

18:52.400 --> 18:54.160
That guy has something to deal with.

18:56.200 --> 18:57.120
The injury isn't serious.

18:57.560 --> 18:58.600
so the doctor let him go since he’s quite stable.

19:01.520 --> 19:04.240
Although the doctor referred him
to the psychiatric department

19:04.960 --> 19:06.520
because they thought that he tried to kill himself.

19:07.000 --> 19:08.200
So I told the doctor,

19:09.120 --> 19:09.920
“Doctor, sir.

19:10.640 --> 19:11.920
he only did that to get back at his boyfriend”

19:13.320 --> 19:15.680
But the doctor insisted that he should be
cleared by a psychiatrist anyway.

19:19.080 --> 19:20.920
He really needs a good therapist anyway.

19:28.360 --> 19:30.080
You say nothing about the fact that
I call you his boyfriend,

19:31.120 --> 19:32.480
so you…

19:33.600 --> 19:35.320
are really becoming Mr. Three baht?

19:35.360 --> 19:35.640
Huh?

19:35.960 --> 19:36.400
Right?

19:36.480 --> 19:36.880
Huh?

19:37.200 --> 19:37.920
Mr. Three baht

19:38.160 --> 19:38.760
Mr. Three baht

19:39.080 --> 19:39.840
Mr. Three baht

19:40.360 --> 19:41.840
Hoo! Hoo! Hoo!

19:44.600 --> 19:45.400
It’s not like that.

19:49.360 --> 19:50.400
Whatever,

19:55.360 --> 19:58.120
I'm sorry for my beloved nephew.

19:59.720 --> 20:02.760
Sometimes he likes to be self-centered like a child.

20:04.880 --> 20:05.920
But after this,

20:07.160 --> 20:09.440
I need you to control his behavior.

20:10.800 --> 20:11.200
I think…

20:11.240 --> 20:12.760
You can do it, right?

20:13.600 --> 20:14.400
Huh?

20:15.520 --> 20:17.160
Good, good.

20:19.800 --> 20:20.560
I'm glad that

20:22.160 --> 20:23.080
you're not dead.

20:27.160 --> 20:28.440
You're Mr. Three Baht.

20:29.680 --> 20:31.360
That means you're family.

20:34.840 --> 20:35.640
Family

20:38.040 --> 20:39.360
needs to rely on each other.

20:51.520 --> 20:52.640
You stay here.

20:58.520 --> 20:59.360
I have to go.

21:10.720 --> 21:12.160
Please take care of him for me.

21:13.160 --> 21:13.960
Yes.

21:29.440 --> 21:31.440
You didn’t have to lie to me.

21:34.600 --> 21:35.160
I…

21:35.200 --> 21:37.520
You want me to feel even more guilty?

21:43.240 --> 21:45.760
Let’s go back to your room.

21:54.640 --> 21:56.160
You’re invited to the meeting. Click the link below to join.

22:06.640 --> 22:07.360
Hello, all of you.

22:07.560 --> 22:08.040
Hello, sir.

22:08.080 --> 22:09.160
Sit down, sit down, please.

22:12.080 --> 22:12.880
Thank you so much.

22:14.800 --> 22:17.280
Sorry to keep you all waiting.

22:18.360 --> 22:19.280
We can start now.

22:21.920 --> 22:23.240
Alright, I’m going to cut to the chase now.

22:24.880 --> 22:26.000
Our company

22:26.520 --> 22:30.120
has improved significantly over the past several years.

22:31.400 --> 22:34.800
We are now the leading entertainment company in the country.

22:37.920 --> 22:40.920
Even though what we still lack now is funding.

22:42.760 --> 22:46.080
And that is the reason why Mr.Songpol is here with us today.

22:51.200 --> 22:52.480
The chairman and the board members

22:52.520 --> 22:54.320
have proposed a merger of the company.

22:54.520 --> 22:57.120
Between Dream Entertainment and SPG

22:57.960 --> 23:00.680
where the SPG will be a major investor.

23:01.360 --> 23:02.880
They will increase the capital by three times

23:02.920 --> 23:05.000
the company's market capitalization.

23:06.040 --> 23:07.520
And we also would like to propose a name
change of the company to

23:07.680 --> 23:10.160
SPDream for our unity.

23:12.360 --> 23:13.480
It sounds good.

23:14.080 --> 23:15.360
But why is it so sudden?

23:15.480 --> 23:16.640
It's not sudden at all.

23:17.320 --> 23:20.080
All propose is for the future of SPDream

23:21.000 --> 23:22.760
which will grow to be the leader

23:23.520 --> 23:25.040
in the industry globally.

23:25.560 --> 23:26.280
Besides,

23:26.560 --> 23:29.120
the board members demanded the removal of Director Arthur

23:29.680 --> 23:30.920
from Dream Entertainment.

23:34.840 --> 23:36.160
As you all know,

23:37.680 --> 23:39.680
Director Arthur actions,

23:40.240 --> 23:41.600
what he has done without consulting others.

23:41.920 --> 23:44.360
His action has damaged the company gravely.

23:45.600 --> 23:49.400
Yeah, he ruined many good deals that I've made.

23:51.200 --> 23:53.200
And also his arrogant demeanor

23:53.800 --> 23:55.880
has given the company bad publicity.

23:57.240 --> 23:58.360
Not to mention that

23:59.160 --> 24:01.160
he just signed off on tens of millions Baht

24:01.440 --> 24:03.400
to approve that unknown indie woman director

24:03.800 --> 24:05.200
on a random project.

24:05.760 --> 24:06.520
You’re right.

24:10.520 --> 24:12.360
I understand everyone's frustration,

24:12.760 --> 24:15.440
so should we vote now?

24:19.920 --> 24:20.800
Who will vote to dismiss him from the position?

24:44.000 --> 24:45.720
Are you trying to fire me?

25:03.400 --> 25:07.040
Sometimes Jay still has a mischievous side.

25:08.160 --> 25:08.960
Have a look at this.

25:21.040 --> 25:23.240
How did you know Jay?

25:30.000 --> 25:32.520
I was a bodyguard for Jay's mother.

25:38.360 --> 25:40.760
I had worked with her for the longest time.

25:43.520 --> 25:44.880
I made a mistake that day.

25:47.040 --> 25:47.320
Yes?

25:49.760 --> 25:51.160
A parcel for Ms. Pavinee?

26:00.400 --> 26:01.200
Yes, yes.

26:27.480 --> 26:30.160
I only let you out of my sight for a second.

26:30.720 --> 26:31.200
What!

26:33.680 --> 26:34.600
No, what is happening to her?

26:40.800 --> 26:41.600
Boss!

26:43.000 --> 26:43.800
Boss!

26:44.440 --> 26:45.160
Miss Pavinee!

27:02.960 --> 27:08.240
Jay and I met again at his mother's funeral.

27:10.280 --> 27:11.440
You think you're so tough, don't you?

27:25.880 --> 27:29.280
At first, it was just helping to vent the sadness.

27:46.880 --> 27:50.240
But it turned out that I broke his right arm.

28:03.160 --> 28:03.960
Oh, yeah.

28:06.320 --> 28:07.800
So it's you who hurt it.

28:08.320 --> 28:12.560
I’m too old now, my knees are hurting. I need my med now.

28:13.760 --> 28:15.240
My knees feel weak.

28:18.720 --> 28:20.400
Even if you want to fire me,

28:21.720 --> 28:23.320
but I still own ten percent of this company.

28:24.760 --> 28:26.240
So I’m still allowed to attend this meeting.

28:41.080 --> 28:43.240
So now I'm going to propose

28:43.840 --> 28:46.880
we should put the dismissal of Director Arthur
on hold for now.

28:49.920 --> 28:51.640
If we talk about performance,

28:52.560 --> 28:55.720
Director Arthur has always provided new connections for us.

28:55.920 --> 28:56.720
Hasn’t he?

28:59.920 --> 29:01.000
Our profits sink

29:01.760 --> 29:03.240
due to his little projects.

29:03.760 --> 29:05.000
So I don’t think his performance is that good.

29:05.520 --> 29:07.720
We should talk about the numbers, Vice President.

29:09.160 --> 29:10.320
If you want to talk about numbers,

29:11.880 --> 29:13.240
I also have something to propose too.

29:15.360 --> 29:17.760
This is not your place to do so anymore.

29:19.360 --> 29:21.200
You're so naive.

29:24.440 --> 29:27.640
As far as I know,

29:28.880 --> 29:31.000
Dream is still growing nonstop,

29:32.360 --> 29:34.360
but you're here acting like a child.

29:34.720 --> 29:37.320
Who would want to waste time listening to you?

29:39.160 --> 29:40.160
And actually,

29:40.600 --> 29:43.640
now you're not involved in The Memory Project anymore.

29:45.720 --> 29:47.040
But I’m just going to spare you the information that

29:47.560 --> 29:49.000
we’re already done with the casting process,

29:49.440 --> 29:50.720
and we already made deals with sponsors.

29:51.440 --> 29:54.120
It's only a matter of when we'll start filming,
and it'll be soon.

29:54.800 --> 29:59.200
Now, many countries have made deals to
buy the streaming rights.

30:07.320 --> 30:08.120
Well,

30:09.360 --> 30:11.880
you’ve done things very quickly and impressively.

30:12.520 --> 30:16.120
I never thought you had already signed contracts
with other countries.

30:18.560 --> 30:19.920
But is it really going that well?

30:21.920 --> 30:24.760
You’re obviously visionless.

30:25.760 --> 30:27.880
We’re about to start filming, and you’re asking this?

30:29.320 --> 30:31.160
Well, that is as far as it can go.

30:32.240 --> 30:33.320
What a stupid question.

30:35.680 --> 30:36.680
Mr Songpol?

30:37.640 --> 30:38.440
Actually no,

30:39.320 --> 30:42.280
nobody in here has read that contract, right?

30:50.200 --> 30:54.000
If you read it carefully, you wouldn’t dare fire me.

30:57.560 --> 31:00.040
So, no one reviews the production list

31:00.040 --> 31:01.280
that needs to be processed before filming, right?

31:02.880 --> 31:04.520
In it, it’s clearly stated that

31:05.160 --> 31:06.760
the series will have a song

31:07.360 --> 31:09.840
that originally made for the series from beginning
to end of the series.

31:11.360 --> 31:14.800
Did you guys have the rights to use that song?

31:28.880 --> 31:30.400
The copyright of that song,

31:31.360 --> 31:34.920
I'm the only one in the world who owns it.

31:43.240 --> 31:46.560
I told you I’m not going to sell the copyright to Dream.

31:47.160 --> 31:48.960
I didn't come as a representative from Dream.

31:53.760 --> 31:54.560
Here.

31:57.400 --> 32:00.600
I know you were promised a very unfair contract earlier.

32:02.200 --> 32:03.560
They said your song

32:03.800 --> 32:04.760
will not last very long.

32:05.360 --> 32:06.360
And then it will become outdated.

32:07.880 --> 32:10.720
But I believe your song will become a legendary song

32:11.960 --> 32:13.160
that stay with us for a long time.

32:15.760 --> 32:17.160
At first, I didn't think this song

32:17.760 --> 32:19.480
would be worth that much.

32:20.520 --> 32:23.640
Would you like to sell it to me?

32:34.720 --> 32:38.160
You’re saying that I can add terms
to terminate the contract,

32:39.000 --> 32:41.840
in case they don't use my original lyrics?

32:42.520 --> 32:45.360
Yes, you should not be exploited twice.

32:46.440 --> 32:47.560
Because you wrote it.

32:49.080 --> 32:51.240
This right should be yours from the beginning.

32:52.040 --> 32:53.160
Thank you.

32:53.720 --> 32:54.840
Thank you very much.

32:55.440 --> 32:56.360
It's a pleasure.

33:02.440 --> 33:04.000
Manhattan

33:11.120 --> 33:12.120
You sold everything,

33:14.920 --> 33:16.480
What would you do with that money?

33:20.680 --> 33:21.840
I want to buy the copyright to a song.

33:25.120 --> 33:26.360
Isn't it a little expensive?

33:36.440 --> 33:37.920
If it’s the price of getting revenge,

33:39.800 --> 33:41.520
then nothing is too expensive for me.

33:46.040 --> 33:47.440
You are really your mother’s son.

33:56.160 --> 33:57.360
Or to be clear,

33:58.160 --> 34:02.280
I hold the public distribution rights
to the song for 10 years.

34:04.440 --> 34:07.040
And I won't allow you to use it.

34:08.120 --> 34:09.600
If based on the contract,

34:10.600 --> 34:13.120
you guys have exactly ten years to produce this series.

34:15.080 --> 34:16.600
Although if you breach the contract,

34:17.560 --> 34:18.560
how much do you have to pay?

34:22.639 --> 34:24.159
We don't need that song.

34:24.440 --> 34:25.840
We can use other songs instead.

34:27.880 --> 34:28.719
It’s just a song.

34:30.400 --> 34:32.320
I don't need your permission for it.

34:32.960 --> 34:36.159
I can just find someone to compose the song similarly,
or just compose a new one.

34:36.520 --> 34:37.520
It’s not that hard.

34:39.159 --> 34:39.960
Whew.

34:41.880 --> 34:43.199
Then I have no other choice.

34:43.719 --> 34:44.719
Besides suing for copyright infringement.

34:46.000 --> 34:46.560
You know, right?

34:47.639 --> 34:49.360
I don't care about the outcome of the court's decision.

34:50.960 --> 34:52.159
But I'm sure that

34:52.440 --> 34:54.199
I can just delay this case for a decade.

34:54.960 --> 34:55.800
Of course, I can do it easily.

35:00.440 --> 35:03.040
Check the contract with the copyright owner.

35:08.960 --> 35:10.080
The contract states that

35:11.000 --> 35:13.560
the content can only be edited
if it's approved by the writer.

35:14.320 --> 35:15.160
And importantly,

35:15.720 --> 35:18.280
the content that writers absolutely do not allow is

35:19.000 --> 35:20.200
the lyrics used in the epigraph.

35:21.000 --> 35:23.560
I highlighted for you all on page seven.

35:31.960 --> 35:33.760
Where lyrics are adapted.

35:34.280 --> 35:35.440
will be considered to have broken the contract,

35:36.520 --> 35:38.480
the writer can cancel the contract immediately.

35:39.000 --> 35:41.000
All fines and compensation

35:42.320 --> 35:43.960
must make your head spin.

35:46.240 --> 35:47.360
Entertainment industry

35:48.120 --> 35:49.440
is highly risky.

35:50.280 --> 35:52.720
You probably already have considered
this level of risk beforehand.

35:53.600 --> 35:54.960
But when the damage is done,

35:55.840 --> 35:57.800
it will have your name all over it.

35:59.680 --> 36:00.720
Get him out of here.

36:01.560 --> 36:02.680
Get his ass out of here!

36:04.400 --> 36:08.320
Oh, about the motion to remove me.

36:09.040 --> 36:09.760
you guys can continue discussing.

36:10.960 --> 36:13.920
How many people have agreed to fire me?

36:21.840 --> 36:22.720
No one?

36:26.120 --> 36:27.520
I do have one motion that I’d like to propose,

36:32.960 --> 36:34.520
I’m going to fire all of you.

36:38.040 --> 36:41.800
You want to destroy this place?

36:43.160 --> 36:44.680
You can’t do that.

36:45.200 --> 36:47.720
Right! You just own a copyright to a song.

36:48.040 --> 36:49.880
You don’t have that much power over us.

36:50.920 --> 36:52.960
You think that you’re the owner of Dream or something?

36:53.920 --> 36:56.080
Yes, Dream is mine.

36:56.960 --> 36:59.360
I am the rightful owner of the company.

37:03.920 --> 37:05.920
This must clearly be a sitcom joke.

37:17.000 --> 37:20.040
If you’re going to fantasize, at least make it believable.

37:21.640 --> 37:22.440
That's right.

37:23.160 --> 37:24.160
I think with these symptoms,

37:25.200 --> 37:26.360
you really need a therapist.

37:32.680 --> 37:33.480
Fine.

37:34.400 --> 37:36.000
Let's get back to the numbers.

37:38.480 --> 37:41.200
So, I have the right to serve as the company's president with my 10% stake.

37:41.760 --> 37:45.040
Combined with my mother's stake.

37:47.200 --> 37:48.480
the total came out to be 61 percent.

37:49.040 --> 37:50.000
Ms. Pavinee,

37:54.120 --> 37:55.120
Is he really a son of…

37:57.800 --> 37:58.920
I can assure you that

37:59.160 --> 38:04.120
Mr. Arthur is the only son of Ms. Pavinee.

38:07.920 --> 38:08.720
What!

38:09.240 --> 38:10.560
Wait, wait, wait, wait.

38:11.920 --> 38:13.320
So what if you’re her child?

38:14.440 --> 38:18.200
Didn't Ms.Pavinee give all of her shares to Mr. Kongkiat?

38:19.480 --> 38:20.280
So what?

38:24.000 --> 38:24.800
Please.

38:25.800 --> 38:26.600
Yes, sir.

38:28.000 --> 38:29.360
But it was a wrongful transfer.

38:29.960 --> 38:30.720
Hey!

38:31.640 --> 38:32.920
Don't make things up.

38:33.520 --> 38:34.960
Otherwise, I can sue you.

38:38.720 --> 38:40.520
Why would my mother transfer her shares to you,

38:42.320 --> 38:44.240
without any money coming to her account?

38:46.520 --> 38:49.160
And the e-mail denying the sale of her shares
that my mother sent you,

38:50.360 --> 38:51.920
have you ever read any of it?

38:55.440 --> 38:56.360
Before her death,

38:58.240 --> 38:59.440
my mother has a will.

39:00.520 --> 39:01.880
By appointing me as the executor of the estate.

39:03.760 --> 39:04.520
And you, my uncle

39:05.720 --> 39:07.240
served as a witness.

39:18.720 --> 39:20.080
This is the document

39:20.880 --> 39:21.720
confirming that

39:22.440 --> 39:23.000
Mr. Athip

39:23.840 --> 39:27.080
holds the majority shareholder of Dream Entertainment.

40:07.480 --> 40:09.360
Now it's time for payback.

40:21.000 --> 40:22.520
He looks quite scary, right?

40:23.800 --> 40:26.200
He’s really exactly like his mother.

40:28.600 --> 40:30.160
If she’s still here,

40:31.480 --> 40:33.120
she would be laughing

40:33.840 --> 40:35.680
for the fact that Jay has shown you this.

40:58.360 --> 40:59.320
This isn’t over yet.

41:02.600 --> 41:04.280
I heard that your heart wasn't good.

41:08.120 --> 41:09.720
Be careful of what you do.

41:32.400 --> 41:33.200
Yes, sir.

41:33.720 --> 41:35.040
I prepared everything for you.

41:35.400 --> 41:36.200
You should leave now,

41:36.560 --> 41:38.160
wait until things blow over, then come back.

41:38.960 --> 41:39.760
Thank you very much.

41:56.120 --> 41:56.800
Ouch!

41:57.560 --> 41:57.960
Hurt.

41:59.720 --> 42:00.520
That’s hurt.

42:01.400 --> 42:02.320
Where does it hurt?

42:05.160 --> 42:06.040
No fever.

42:16.000 --> 42:16.800
Ouch!

42:17.520 --> 42:18.880
What are you doing?

42:20.320 --> 42:21.120
Go.

42:22.240 --> 42:23.040
I’m in pain.

42:42.040 --> 42:43.960
Do you still dare to take a knife for someone else

42:45.040 --> 42:46.640
when I never gave you permission?

42:53.360 --> 42:55.160
I should be able to do things with you,

42:56.720 --> 42:58.360
Instead, I have to keep my hands off you.

42:59.520 --> 43:00.760
It's all your fault.

43:06.960 --> 43:08.720
I'm holding myself back too.

43:14.960 --> 43:16.800
I really want to touch you.

43:39.720 --> 43:42.960
Little bunny, don't change the subject.

43:44.360 --> 43:45.360
And are you still

43:47.080 --> 43:49.040
not going to answer my call?

43:58.320 --> 44:00.640
Well, I won’t when I’m busy.

44:06.360 --> 44:07.880
Fine, just answer your call from now?

44:09.720 --> 44:10.520
Done!

44:12.000 --> 44:13.400
You’re going to rip my wound open.

44:28.640 --> 44:30.160
Don't take your eyes off me.

45:19.960 --> 45:20.720
Hey!

45:20.960 --> 45:21.840
Why are you stopping the car?

45:23.240 --> 45:24.360
Sleep well, didn’t you?

45:25.600 --> 45:27.520
I've been waiting to play with you for a while.

45:54.720 --> 45:55.880
Go!

46:07.760 --> 46:09.760
I’ve been expecting you.

46:11.400 --> 46:14.520
At first, I wanted to use you to celebrate my victory.

46:16.640 --> 46:17.440
But since,

46:20.160 --> 46:21.520
you’re being like this.

46:22.160 --> 46:24.200
Consider this your last day on earth.

46:29.120 --> 46:29.920
Let me go!

46:29.960 --> 46:30.720
Get off me!

46:32.200 --> 46:33.160
I dare you to try shoving it in,

46:33.360 --> 46:34.760
I’m going to bite the whole thing out.

46:36.800 --> 46:38.160
Still being smart-mouthed, huh?

46:39.160 --> 46:40.320
Here for being a smart-mouthed.

46:58.760 --> 47:00.600
Have you ever heard of an electric eel?

47:06.600 --> 47:08.160
This is a police officer.

47:09.400 --> 47:11.000
This is my kingdom.

47:11.560 --> 47:12.960
How could you break in?

47:13.160 --> 47:14.320
I said put the weapon down.

47:14.800 --> 47:15.840
How did you get in?

47:16.520 --> 47:17.080
Let me go!

47:17.280 --> 47:17.960
Get off me!

47:18.320 --> 47:19.080
I told you to let me go!

47:19.720 --> 47:20.680
Let me go!

47:55.440 --> 47:56.280
Get up carefully.

48:01.040 --> 48:01.880
Sit here.

48:11.600 --> 48:13.400
This is you in the video, right?

48:17.640 --> 48:18.440
Yes, sir.

49:35.240 --> 49:36.520
Take your money back!

49:37.280 --> 49:38.800
And stop messing with my life.

49:41.360 --> 49:43.000
That's not enough.

49:44.040 --> 49:45.560
You're not going to stop, are you?

49:47.160 --> 49:49.160
How long are you going to keep holding a grudge against me?

49:51.720 --> 49:52.960
What happened five years ago,

49:56.400 --> 49:58.680
you've never felt ashamed, have you?

50:03.960 --> 50:05.440
Why should I be ashamed?

50:07.000 --> 50:08.920
The person to be ashamed of is you, isn't it?

50:11.960 --> 50:12.960
As for the money,

50:14.120 --> 50:15.360
I never wanted it in the first place.

50:17.720 --> 50:18.640
Because it's dirty money.

50:20.120 --> 50:21.960
It’s the money that you extorted from others.

50:23.720 --> 50:25.680
And for the reason that your mother and brother are dead,

50:27.320 --> 50:28.880
it has nothing to do with me.

50:32.040 --> 50:33.480
Everything happened because of you.

50:35.880 --> 50:37.120
You are a damn murderer.

50:56.840 --> 50:58.040
Now that you are unemployed,

51:01.800 --> 51:02.800
with no backer.

51:09.200 --> 51:10.320
It might come in handy.

51:12.040 --> 51:13.280
Do you think you won?

51:15.200 --> 51:16.960
I only allow you this once.

51:18.720 --> 51:19.800
And I’m telling you this.

51:21.000 --> 51:22.600
I’m going take everything that belongs to you,

51:24.160 --> 51:26.080
including Director Arthur.

51:27.120 --> 51:28.320
Are you calling me?

51:32.760 --> 51:33.520
We see each other again,

51:34.360 --> 51:35.400
Director Arthur.

51:36.840 --> 51:37.880
But I don't want to see you.

51:40.080 --> 51:41.120
The only one I want to see

51:43.160 --> 51:43.600
is this person here.

51:59.720 --> 52:00.600
Why are you still looking?

52:03.160 --> 52:05.000
If you’re uncomfortable seeing people in love

52:06.720 --> 52:08.000
Then get the hell out of here.

52:40.160 --> 52:41.800
This is my revenge,

52:44.600 --> 52:46.360
but you’re the one who ends it.

52:48.440 --> 52:49.480
What are you talking about?

52:51.520 --> 52:53.320
Isn't this your plan from the beginning,

52:54.160 --> 52:56.080
to use Director Arthur to your advantage.

53:01.160 --> 53:02.240
I’m just wondering

53:03.760 --> 53:05.720
why don't I feel happy at all?

53:16.720 --> 53:18.920
And I don't think that I need you to help me.

53:25.920 --> 53:26.720
I have to,

53:28.440 --> 53:30.160
you bought me for the price of a thousand

53:31.720 --> 53:33.040
and two baht.

54:47.920 --> 54:50.840
Six months later

55:01.080 --> 55:02.600
Hello to all the press,

55:02.640 --> 55:03.960
and all the fans.

55:04.960 --> 55:06.360
Before we get started,

55:07.040 --> 55:09.840
please welcome, the director and the cast to the main stage.

55:27.440 --> 55:28.240
Everyone,

55:29.360 --> 55:32.520
this project was not created to compete with anyone,

55:33.320 --> 55:36.320
ingrained gracefully in the memory of all of you.

55:37.040 --> 55:39.560
The Memory The Series is ready.

55:40.200 --> 55:42.040
We will make the world share this memory together.

55:47.040 --> 55:48.360
Oh, I thought it wouldn't be able to be here in time.

55:48.440 --> 55:49.360
The traffic jam is really jamming.

55:50.000 --> 55:50.840
How are you?

55:51.560 --> 55:52.760
Well, fine.

55:53.720 --> 55:55.520
PEN-NUENG just got to be a presenter on a product,

55:56.520 --> 55:58.000
of course, with my selling skills.

56:00.360 --> 56:01.440
I'm good, right?

56:02.480 --> 56:05.560
How lucky are you to have me as a manager?

56:10.680 --> 56:12.480
You really like to give yourself compliments, do you?

56:18.560 --> 56:20.640
So how is it? Audition for the male lead for the first time.

56:21.520 --> 56:23.360
Even if you didn't get the role, you still got something out of it, didn't you?

56:25.360 --> 56:26.160
It's fun.

56:27.600 --> 56:28.560
Considered it an experience.

56:34.800 --> 56:38.000
It's not easy, but the people around me

56:38.040 --> 56:40.000
encourage me very well.

56:40.080 --> 56:44.400
My manager, people in the company, and all the cast friends.

56:48.000 --> 56:49.960
Why don't you just pull some strings
with the president, then?

56:51.280 --> 56:52.080
I can't.

56:53.160 --> 56:55.160
He doesn’t like to pull any strings for me.

56:56.600 --> 56:58.200
Maybe he likes to keep you for himself.

57:00.520 --> 57:01.320
What?

57:02.080 --> 57:02.920
Ugh! Nothing.

57:46.640 --> 57:47.480
Thank you.

57:49.400 --> 57:50.680
You seem excited.

57:50.720 --> 57:53.120
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

57:54.120 --> 57:56.560
My puppy, you look handsome today.

57:57.160 --> 57:58.040
Of course,

57:58.080 --> 57:59.080
I'm just that handsome every day.

57:59.280 --> 58:00.600
Only you have never seen that side of me.

58:01.240 --> 58:02.040
Let's take a picture.

58:02.960 --> 58:04.160
Can I bother anyone to take a picture for us?

58:04.200 --> 58:04.840
Thank you P’Sun.

58:05.160 --> 58:05.760
Congratulations.

58:06.960 --> 58:07.760
Truly, thank you.

58:08.360 --> 58:09.200
Sorry to bother.

58:09.440 --> 58:10.640
Thank you very much.

58:11.280 --> 58:12.560
Take a picture for us, please.

58:15.360 --> 58:16.160
Excuse me.

58:21.280 --> 58:23.440
Oh! Pakin

58:31.840 --> 58:33.960
1! 2! 3! Nice!

58:41.480 --> 58:42.400
Congratulations.

58:45.920 --> 58:49.360
I can't believe you can finish filming this.

58:53.520 --> 58:54.360
Thank you

58:55.440 --> 58:56.240
Thank you for what?

58:56.960 --> 58:58.560
You have to thank them.

59:02.560 --> 59:04.200
Your last nude pictures,

59:04.360 --> 59:05.520
I’m going to keep it for now..

59:07.440 --> 59:08.720
Once you’re famous,

59:09.160 --> 59:10.000
I'm posting them.

59:11.440 --> 59:12.240
It won't be long.

59:13.960 --> 59:14.920
Wait, wait, wait.

59:14.960 --> 59:16.760
When did that happen?

59:17.520 --> 59:18.720
I won't bother you any longer.

59:22.520 --> 59:24.520
Oh, teacher Phueng.

59:24.720 --> 59:25.240
Hello.

59:25.280 --> 59:26.200
It’s nothing, really.

59:26.240 --> 59:27.600
How are you doing lately?

59:28.080 --> 59:28.800
Let’s eat Mala today.

59:29.240 --> 59:29.600
Yeah.

59:30.880 --> 59:31.680
Of course, papaya salad it is.

59:33.520 --> 59:34.520
When did you shoot them?

59:35.920 --> 59:36.200
When?

59:36.360 --> 59:36.680
Sun!

59:39.600 --> 59:40.320
Hello.

59:40.560 --> 59:41.360
How are you?

59:41.960 --> 59:43.960
Do you have any time available for me?

59:45.720 --> 59:46.720
I have some free time.

59:48.720 --> 59:49.520
That's great.

59:50.080 --> 59:52.400
I'm going to film another short movie soon.

59:52.960 --> 59:55.360
I have a role that I think would suit you very well.

59:57.120 --> 59:58.160
It’s the supporting male lead role.

01:00:01.720 --> 01:00:04.680
Oh my god.

01:00:05.960 --> 01:00:07.400
He’s free, very free.

01:00:08.720 --> 01:00:10.040
Then we'll talk again soon.

01:00:10.160 --> 01:00:10.960
Alright.

01:00:11.360 --> 01:00:11.920
See you later.

01:00:11.960 --> 01:00:12.520
Goodbye.

01:00:21.880 --> 01:00:22.680
P’Kajorn

01:00:23.120 --> 01:00:23.360
Yes?

01:00:24.240 --> 01:00:25.160
I'll be right back.

01:00:25.800 --> 01:00:26.800
Yeah, yeah.

01:00:30.400 --> 01:00:31.240
How are you?

01:00:34.720 --> 01:00:37.120
Fortunately, I'm not dead yet.

01:00:41.080 --> 01:00:41.960
Actually,

01:00:43.160 --> 01:00:44.880
I wanted to thank you for that night.

01:00:46.440 --> 01:00:47.480
The police said that

01:00:48.400 --> 01:00:50.400
someone sent the video and the location to them

01:00:54.440 --> 01:00:55.800
I didn't do it for you.

01:00:58.840 --> 01:01:01.680
I knew you'd say that.

01:01:04.800 --> 01:01:06.400
But I want to thank you anyway.

01:01:08.760 --> 01:01:09.560
And...

01:01:11.840 --> 01:01:12.720
About Wave...

01:01:15.480 --> 01:01:16.280
Wave?

01:01:17.880 --> 01:01:18.680
Why?

01:01:23.120 --> 01:01:24.960
After everything was exposed,

01:01:26.520 --> 01:01:28.120
I couldn’t get a hold of him.

01:01:31.480 --> 01:01:33.080
I thought he was probably running from the police.

01:01:37.200 --> 01:01:38.400
Now I heard about him again,

01:01:40.720 --> 01:01:42.360
he was overdosed on drugs.

01:02:01.520 --> 01:02:03.040
What are you going to do?

01:02:05.600 --> 01:02:06.600
Once I survived all that,

01:02:09.120 --> 01:02:10.480
I realised that revenge no longer matters to me anymore.

01:02:11.960 --> 01:02:14.360
Not as important as being alive, anyway.

01:02:17.240 --> 01:02:18.400
Now that I think like that,

01:02:19.520 --> 01:02:20.720
things are definitely do not feel as heavy anymore.

01:02:22.960 --> 01:02:24.160
As for the rest,

01:02:28.560 --> 01:02:30.040
we'll just have to keep pushing forward.

01:02:37.040 --> 01:02:37.840
I’m sorry.

01:02:40.960 --> 01:02:42.400
You don't need to apologize.

01:02:43.680 --> 01:02:45.280
It's not your fault alone.

01:03:04.240 --> 01:03:05.000
How?

01:03:05.160 --> 01:03:05.800
Do it like this.

01:03:07.320 --> 01:03:07.640
Right.

01:03:07.800 --> 01:03:08.280
Go for it.

01:03:09.280 --> 01:03:10.160
Hey, almost got it.

01:03:10.360 --> 01:03:11.160
Are you sure?

01:03:11.200 --> 01:03:12.280
One more time, please.

01:03:13.360 --> 01:03:14.760
Next one say to bro, okay?

01:03:14.960 --> 01:03:15.400
Okay.

01:03:17.360 --> 01:03:18.160
Yo Bro!

01:03:19.000 --> 01:03:21.480
Hey don’t.

01:03:21.960 --> 01:03:23.000
Don’t use your Gen Z slang with elder.

01:03:23.240 --> 01:03:23.760
Whisk

01:03:23.960 --> 01:03:25.760
Bro! Bro means brother.

01:03:25.960 --> 01:03:26.320
No, no, no.

01:03:26.360 --> 01:03:27.000
Right, bro?

01:03:32.680 --> 01:03:33.280
Yo Bro!

01:03:33.640 --> 01:03:33.960
Yo Bro!

01:03:33.960 --> 01:03:34.960
Excuse me

01:03:38.520 --> 01:03:39.320
Oh, yeah.

01:03:40.880 --> 01:03:41.920
Okay.

01:03:44.160 --> 01:03:46.160
Can we take a photo with?

01:03:46.240 --> 01:03:47.240
Can I get a photo with him? I'm a fan club.

01:03:47.360 --> 01:03:48.360
Oh, okay.

01:03:48.520 --> 01:03:50.480
I take a photo.

01:03:51.120 --> 01:03:51.720
Okay.

01:03:57.560 --> 01:03:59.320
One, two, three!

01:04:01.280 --> 01:04:02.840
One, two, three!

01:04:04.880 --> 01:04:05.720
Sia Po’s calling!

01:04:08.640 --> 01:04:11.160
One, two, three!

01:04:23.360 --> 01:04:24.160
Yes, Sia.

01:04:26.280 --> 01:04:27.840
The debtor you sent me,

01:04:28.160 --> 01:04:29.480
he can’t do anything for shit.

01:04:29.920 --> 01:04:30.560
Well,

01:04:30.680 --> 01:04:32.960
It never makes money to pay the debt on time.

01:04:33.880 --> 01:04:35.320
Not only that but, last time

01:04:35.680 --> 01:04:37.200
do you know what he asked me to do?

01:04:38.880 --> 01:04:39.720
What is it?

01:04:40.200 --> 01:04:41.800
Yeah, wait and see.

01:04:41.960 --> 01:04:43.080
I will send you a link.

01:04:43.560 --> 01:04:45.320
And then you prepare to press subscribe

01:04:45.360 --> 01:04:46.200
and share, okay?

01:04:54.040 --> 01:04:55.200
Hi my lords,

01:04:55.360 --> 01:04:59.280
once you join my live, don’t forget to send me gifts.

01:04:59.800 --> 01:05:03.320
And then you get to see something deeper
than you've ever seen.

01:05:11.680 --> 01:05:14.480
Five years is the time that
I learned and tried to understand.

01:05:15.360 --> 01:05:17.360
I learned and tried to understand.

01:05:19.240 --> 01:05:20.720
I still think about Bank.

01:05:21.960 --> 01:05:23.880
The person who used to take my name.

01:05:23.920 --> 01:05:24.800
Camera!

01:05:28.160 --> 01:05:28.800
Are you guys ready?

01:05:30.080 --> 01:05:31.200
If you are then,

01:05:33.280 --> 01:05:34.080
Action!

01:05:35.640 --> 01:05:36.520
Don't come in.

01:05:36.880 --> 01:05:38.000
Don't come in just one by one.

01:05:39.080 --> 01:05:40.160
Just all of you come in at the same time.

01:05:54.520 --> 01:05:54.960
Good!

01:05:57.160 --> 01:05:58.120
Stronger!

01:05:58.280 --> 01:05:59.880
He could be another one of my identities

01:06:00.880 --> 01:06:02.760
that still lives the same way.

01:06:03.520 --> 01:06:06.360
He still can't even recognize his own mistakes.

01:06:07.960 --> 01:06:10.360
I don't know how long it would take Bank to understand

01:06:12.160 --> 01:06:13.880
because becoming a new person is hard.

01:06:15.280 --> 01:06:19.600
But being self-aware is even harder.

01:06:33.640 --> 01:06:34.520
Good luck to you.

01:06:44.800 --> 01:06:45.720
Want to jump down?

01:06:54.560 --> 01:06:55.560
If you want to jump,

01:06:58.240 --> 01:06:59.160
I can help by pushing your back.

01:07:00.440 --> 01:07:00.880
Do you want it?

01:07:04.920 --> 01:07:05.720
No.

01:07:08.160 --> 01:07:09.200
If you’re planning on doing that,

01:07:10.440 --> 01:07:13.600
I’ll be the one to push you down first.

01:07:15.720 --> 01:07:16.480
So that I can have freedom.

01:07:20.080 --> 01:07:20.960
Freedom?

01:07:24.480 --> 01:07:25.200
So you know,

01:07:26.280 --> 01:07:27.560
the reason that you don’t have freedom?

01:07:30.720 --> 01:07:31.840
It’s because all of you

01:07:33.200 --> 01:07:33.960
is mine.

01:07:46.600 --> 01:07:49.760
So what is the capital city of Lithuania?

01:07:53.160 --> 01:07:54.360
You asked me that a long time ago,

01:07:55.720 --> 01:07:57.080
still want the answer now?

01:07:58.200 --> 01:07:59.000
So?

01:08:02.160 --> 01:08:03.160
It’s Vilnius.

01:08:12.400 --> 01:08:13.960
We'll be going there next week.

01:08:18.120 --> 01:08:18.600
Huh?

01:08:20.600 --> 01:08:22.359
So, this is your first trip abroad, huh?

01:08:23.800 --> 01:08:24.279
I’m telling you

01:08:25.680 --> 01:08:27.120
that it won’t be your last.

01:08:38.800 --> 01:08:39.600
Do you want it?

01:08:46.960 --> 01:08:48.479
I thought that you’d smoke again.

01:08:52.080 --> 01:08:53.120
I want to,

01:08:55.040 --> 01:08:56.720
but I’ve seen you quit smoking.

01:08:57.680 --> 01:08:59.000
And now smoking alone becomes so boring.

01:09:01.439 --> 01:09:05.040
Then go sell the cigarette for two baht to the new person.

01:09:08.279 --> 01:09:09.279
Mr. Two baht,

01:09:11.600 --> 01:09:13.279
there's only one of you.

01:09:29.319 --> 01:09:30.560
My dummy as well,

01:09:34.359 --> 01:09:36.760
there’s only you that can be my Dummy.
